    <string name="mini_customization">Mini-player styles</string>
    <string name="mini_customization_help">Choose a compact player that fits Pippo. All styles use the existing tap-to-expand and swipe-to-skip gestures. Extra buttons move into More on narrow screens. Classic with default options keeps the original morphing artwork; customized layouts crossfade into the full player. Connected dock aligns the phone player and navigation surfaces. Wide layouts keep their shared dock. Motion follows your animation settings.</string>
